3. CONCRETE BEFORE & AFTER EXAMPLE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Example: Multi-tenant protection for project endpoints and task toggles
  [BEFORE - ProjectService & DashboardService]:
  `resolveProject()` fetched by UUID without verifying active organization; User Alpha could view Beta's overview, tasks, and documents. `toggleTask()` toggled tasks across tenants without checks.

  [AFTER - ProjectService & DashboardService]:
  `resolveProject()` and `toggleTask()` enforce `p.getOrganization().getId().equals(org.getId())`. Unauthorized cross-tenant queries and mutations reject with 400 Bad Request.

